# Settings survive a restart (two of two, after settings_a): every one is back, and a muted
# profile says so once and is unmuted by Ctrl+M wherever the player is (the world, the map, the
# pause menu, photo mode); plain M opens the map and leaves the sound alone; a pan key held into
# the pause menu and let go there does not carry the camera off after Resume.
wait 20
expect page title
expect volume music 50
expect volume effects 50
expect volume ambience 50
expect reduce_motion yes
expect grid yes
expect vsync no
expect ui_scale 1
expect muted yes
click ui:menu:continue
wait 10
expect page none
expect world Settle
expect toast sound is off
shot shots/settings_muted_toast.png
key m
wait 20
expect map open
expect muted yes
key ctrl+m
wait 2
expect muted no
key escape
wait 15
expect map closed
key ctrl+m
wait 2
expect muted yes
key p
wait 6
expect photo on
key ctrl+m
wait 2
expect muted no
key escape
wait 6
expect photo off
key escape
wait 8
expect page pause
key ctrl+m
wait 2
expect muted yes
click ui:menu:pause_settings
wait 8
click ui:menu:mute
wait 2
expect muted no
click ui:menu:done
wait 6
click ui:menu:resume
wait 6
expect page none
expect muted no
# A pan key let go under the pause menu lets go: the camera does not wander off after Resume.
keydown d
wait 5
expect panning yes
key escape
wait 8
expect page pause
keyup d
wait 2
click ui:menu:resume
wait 6
expect page none
expect panning no
quit
